  "body": "This PR sets `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` to 102. It is the bump for the process PRs #2564 and #2571.\n\n- #2564: the release gate has a known-fail list in `xtask` (three tests of #1950).\n- #2571: FreeBSD support is removed from `release.yml` and from the `runners` skill.\n\nClass: MECHANICAL. `cargo xtask process-bump` made the one-line change.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
